%% Data lineage overview for TDD v7
flowchart LR
    A[Audio / Exhibits] -->|Transcribe| B[TRANSCRIPT artifacts]
    B -->|Analyze| C[Analysis artifacts\n(SUMMARY, OUTLINE, TIMELINE, ENTITIES)]
    C -->|Compose| D[Compose deliverables\n(CLIENT / LAWYER / BUNDLE)]
    D -->|Guardian READY| E[Approved artifacts]
    E -->|Signer| F[Signed bundles\n(SIGNATURE_CERT, DOCX/PDF-A)]
    F -->|Portal delivery| G[Client downloads]

    subgraph Ops Telemetry
        B -.->|ops_transcription.jsonl| O1[Transcription audit log]
        C -.->|ops_summary.jsonl| O2[Analyze audit log]
        D -.->|ops_compose.jsonl| O3[Compose audit log]
    end
